{"outcome":"component","existing":"","reason":"","code":"AuthorBio","label":"About the author","description":"A small box presenting the author of an article: a round photo, the name, an optional role, a short biography and an optional link to their other articles. Use it at the end of a blog post or an article.","props":"[{"name": "heading", "type": "text", "label": "Heading", "help": "Optional, such as 'About the author'.", "max": 80}, {"name": "photo", "type": "image", "label": "Photo of the author"}, {"name": "photo_alt", "type": "text", "label": "Alternative text of the photo", "help": "What the photo shows, in one sentence. The name is used when left empty.", "max": 160}, {"name": "name", "type": "text", "label": "Name", "required": true, "max": 80}, {"name": "role", "type": "text", "label": "Role", "help": "Optional, such as the job or the specialty of the author.", "max": 120}, {"name": "bio", "type": "html", "label": "Short biography"}, {"name": "link_label", "type": "text", "label": "Link text", "help": "Says where the link leads, such as 'Read all the articles by this author'.", "max": 80}, {"name": "link_url", "type": "url", "label": "Link address"}]","sample":"{"heading": "À propos de l’auteur", "photo": null, "photo_alt": "Claire Martin souriante, debout dans l’atelier de la boutique.", "name": "Claire Martin", "role": "Fondatrice et créatrice de bijoux", "bio": "<p>Claire crée des bijoux en argent recyclé depuis plus de dix ans. Elle partage ici ses conseils d’entretien et les coulisses de l’atelier.</p>", "link_label": "Lire tous les articles de Claire Martin", "link_url": "/blog/auteurs/claire-martin"}","template":"<section class="author">{% if props.heading is not empty %}<h2 class="author__heading">{{ props.heading }}</h2>{% endif %}<div class="author__body">{% if props.photo %}<div class="author__photo" data-cms-sizes="(min-width: 48rem) 6rem, 4.5rem"><img class="author__img" src="{{ props.photo }}" alt="{{ props.photo_alt|default(props.name) }}" loading="lazy" width="96" height="96"></div>{% endif %}<div class="author__text">{% if props.heading is not empty %}<h3 class="author__name">{{ props.name }}</h3>{% else %}<h2 class="author__name">{{ props.name }}</h2>{% endif %}{% if props.role is not empty %}<p class="author__role">{{ props.role }}</p>{% endif %}{% if props.bio is not empty %}<div class="author__bio">{{ props.bio }}</div>{% endif %}{% if props.link_url is not empty and props.link_label is not empty %}<p class="author__link"><a href="{{ props.link_url }}">{{ props.link_label }}</a></p>{% endif %}</div></div></section>","css":".author { padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--cms-color-border); border-radius: 0.75rem; background: var(--cms-color-surface); color: var(--cms-color-text); }
.author__heading { margin: 0 0 1rem; font-size: 0.85rem; letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--cms-color-text-subtle); }
.author__body { display: flex; gap: 1rem; align-items: flex-start; }
